# Serena MCP (startup)

Cursor launches **Serena** from `.cursor/mcp.json` when this workspace opens (`--context ide --project-from-cwd`).

- Ensure install: `yarn serena:ensure` (or `yarn serena:doctor` check-only)
- Skill: `.agents/skills/serena/SKILL.md`
- Project config: `.serena/project.yml`
- ADR: `next-forge/docs/adr/0013-serena-mcp-startup.md`

Prefer Serena for find-symbol / refs / rename / replace-symbol-body. Prefer lean-ctx `ctx_*` for compressed exploration.

Fullstack kit: Wasp [llms.txt](https://wasp.sh/llms.txt) → [llms-0.24.txt](https://wasp.sh/llms-0.24.txt); `chrome-devtools` MCP; skills `wasp-plugin-init`, `start-dev-server`.
